// Dialog - DoormanIntro 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3342301110" "I see Mordesen has found someone after all. Good, for it is not just the people of <i>Nowhere</i> that need your help, the Carnival believes we are all in danger.<br><br>I know you have come here for your own reasons, but if you wish to gain from this ordeal then you must first understand what it is you will be facing.<br><br>Speak with me if you are ready to learn the truth which so many Praetorians do not know."
// Answer Text :
"P591590492" "Very well."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoormanClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3101529242" "The Doorman"
// DetailString :
"P1620512528" "Carter Mordesen told you about a man in the underground of Praetoria's Imperial City. He is known only as The Doorman.<br><br><i>He guards the door to Nowhere</i>, he said.<br><br>If you want to gain the Carnival as an ally, then you will have to see The Doorman first."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2943562307" "This magical portal links our two worlds together. <color orange>It will take you to the underground of Praetoria's Imperial City where you must speak to Doorman</color>, he guards the door to <i>Nowhere</i>; also known as <color orange>The First Ward</color>. If you wish to gain the Carnival as an ally you will need to speak to the Doorman first.<br><br>The First Ward is a place ripe with suffering as well as opportunity. The people are looking for a savior. Play your hand right and they will worship you as a god."
// AcceptString :
"P3875513145" "Tell me more."
// SendOffString :
"P4085603035" "First Ward is the place that people find themselves when they no longer fit in Cole's carefully orchestrated order. They disappear and are taken to the First Ward; where no one lives, but everyone suffers."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2959590604" "Cross Dimensions and talk to The Doorman"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1875363638" "Only The Doorman can grant you access to Praetoria's First Ward. You can find him on the other side of this magical portal to Praetoria in the Imperial City underground."

